<item><title>Port-Louis sets draw for 320 Night Market stalls after 500 applications</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/port-louis-sets-draw-for-320-night-market-stalls-after-500-df167f/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/port-louis-sets-draw-for-320-night-market-stalls-after-500-df167f/</guid><category>Mauritius</category><description>The 18 December market has drawn about 180 more applicants than spaces, and only traders who live in the city can apply.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 09:40:18 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mu.jpg" length="32856" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mu.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Mauritius sets end-2028 deadline for 3G mobile networks</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/mauritius-sets-end-2028-deadline-for-3g-mobile-networks-7dc4de/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/mauritius-sets-end-2028-deadline-for-3g-mobile-networks-7dc4de/</guid><category>Mauritius</category><description>Operators have begun withdrawing the service on separate schedules, while the regulator requires them to protect coverage and inform subscribers.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 08:43:49 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mu.jpg" length="32856" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mu.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Mauritius&apos;s Competition Commission extends cartel amnesty by three months</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/mauritius-s-competition-commission-extends-cartel-amnesty-e75fdc/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/mauritius-s-competition-commission-extends-cartel-amnesty-e75fdc/</guid><category>Mauritius</category><description>The Competition Commission has moved the deadline of its amnesty programme for collusive practices to 25 February 2027, from the original end date.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 08:04:28 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mu.jpg" length="32856" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mu.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Mauritius court sentences Vedanand Seetul to 36 years in prison</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/mauritius-court-sentences-vedanand-seetul-to-36-years-in-d51981/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mu/mauritius-court-sentences-vedanand-seetul-to-36-years-in-d51981/</guid><category>Mauritius</category><description>A jury found the 52-year-old guilty by seven votes to two over his wife’s death in Lallmatie in 2018.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 06:52:44 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mu.jpg" length="32856" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mu.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
